{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>醫療團隊指教宗良十四世癌細胞沒有擴散　毋須受進一步治療</strong></p><p>・教宗良十四世癌細胞沒有擴散<br>・醫療團隊指毋須接受進一步治療<br>・教宗健康狀況受到關注<br>・屬教宗相關宗教新聞<br>・標題無提供詳細內文</p><p>暫時未能從Now 國際擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.now.com/home/international/player?newsId=666679\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:43.836508+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:39:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.638875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.638875+00:00","content_hash":"cee4a53d4ef9a790d71640417363e863298e091ec8330df6604b328082f9e8e8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}